<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-Merrill downgrades UK equities.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Merrill downgrades UK equities.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Strategists at Merrill Lynch said on Tuesday they have cut their rating on UK equities from overweight to neutral on worries about the interest rate and inflation outlook.</p>
<p>Trevor Greethan, global strategist at the U.S. investment bank told Reuters that resources would be switched into commodity exposed markets such as Australia, Canada and South Africa in the wake of last week's interest rate rise.</p>
</text>
